<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="439037024"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1168993185"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="L.I.F.E."/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Remady / Manu-L"/><amll:meta key="album" value="L.I.F.E."/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:59.506"><div begin="00:05.921" end="02:47.976"><p begin="00:05.921" end="00:08.437" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">I've been walking a thousand miles<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾漫步千里</span></p><p begin="00:08.437" end="00:10.751" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">Too many places<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去过许多地方</span></p><p begin="00:10.751" end="00:13.682" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">And I know there's a reason why<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我明白无论作何选择</span></p><p begin="00:13.682" end="00:15.322" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">Whatever I do<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有个理由支撑我</span></p><p begin="00:15.322" end="00:17.875" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">And the day that I met you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我与你邂逅的那一天</span></p><p begin="00:17.875" end="00:21.429" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">I would always find the way to make it right<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我总能让一切重回美好</span></p><p begin="00:21.429" end="00:24.969" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">Any place, anywhere, any time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论何时 无论何地</span></p><p begin="00:26.372" end="00:29.029" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">Everyday is a winding road<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每一天像是漫长而曲折的路</span></p><p begin="00:29.029" end="00:31.492" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">You gotta ride it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你不得不毅然前行</span></p><p begin="00:31.492" end="00:34.498" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">'Cause I know that I can't be wrong<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我明白我不会出错</span></p><p begin="00:34.498" end="00:36.823" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">Whatever I do<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论我作何选择</span></p><p begin="00:36.823" end="00:38.903" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">And as long as you're with me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要你在我左右</span></p><p begin="00:38.903" end="00:42.416" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">We would always find the strength to carry on<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们总能有勇气继续前行</span></p><p begin="00:42.416" end="00:45.572" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">Any place, anywhere, any time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论何时 无论何地</span></p><p begin="00:46.434" end="00:52.512" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">And these are the days of our lives<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这就是属于我们的人生</span></p><p begin="00:52.512" end="00:56.242" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">And these are the days, are the days<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这就是所谓的人生</span></p><p begin="00:56.242" end="00:58.819" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">Of your life<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">属于你的人生</span></p><p begin="01:07.549" end="01:09.302" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">Of your life<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">属于你的人生</span></p><p begin="01:22.387" end="01:24.614" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">It's how we learn and it's how we grow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这就是我们成熟成长的方式</span></p><p begin="01:24.614" end="01:26.868" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">I gotta be patient<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会耐心等待</span></p><p begin="01:26.868" end="01:29.679" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">All it takes is to let it go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只需要学会放手</span></p><p begin="01:29.679" end="01:31.640" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">I need to know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我需要明白</span></p><p begin="01:31.640" end="01:34.141" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Even if the lights go out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便晦暗无光</span></p><p begin="01:34.141" end="01:38.138" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">Will you ever be the one who stay right by my side?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你永远都会是在我身边的唯一</span></p><p begin="01:38.138" end="01:40.912" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">Any place, anywhere, any time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论何时 无论何地</span></p><p begin="01:42.372" end="01:47.537" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">And these are the days of our lives<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这就是属于我们的人生</span></p><p begin="01:47.537" end="01:51.327" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">And these are the days, are the days<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这就是所谓的人生</span></p><p begin="01:51.327" end="01:54.051" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">Of your life<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">属于你的人生</span></p><p begin="02:02.864" end="02:05.490" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">Of your life<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">属于你的人生</span></p><p begin="02:14.091" end="02:18.416" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">We would always find the strength to carry on<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们总能有勇气继续前行</span></p><p begin="02:19.101" end="02:23.057" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">Any place, anywhere, any time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论何时 无论何地</span></p><p begin="02:24.561" end="02:29.927" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">And these are the days of our lives<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这就是属于我们的人生</span></p><p begin="02:33.837" end="02:36.200" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">Of your life<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">属于你的人生</span></p><p begin="02:44.810" end="02:47.976" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">Of your life<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">属于你的人生</span></p></div></body></tt>